[0.571, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[0.021, "o", "41:Omarchy floats every Steam window by default, so the client opens as a centered window instead of joining the tiling layout. If you'd rather the main window tile like any other app, add this to the bottom of `~/.config/hypr/hyprland.lua`:\r\n44:o.window({ class = \"steam\", title = \"Steam\" }, { tile = true })\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "47:Window rules are applied top to bottom and the last match wins, so this re-tiles only the main client. Steam's login prompt, Friends List, Settings, and popup menus all keep floating.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "pr-10123-done\r\n"]
[0.038, "o", "\u001b]0;user@omarchy:~\u0007"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
